#Fill in the "encoded:" block at the bottom of the script: delete the placeholder
	line, then in vim run :r !base64 /path/to/pub/key/on/attack_host (pointed at
	the attack host's actual pubkey) to embed it in place. Skipping this leaves
	a non-base64 placeholder that will silently corrupt the key on the target.
